<article class=3D"doc">
<h1 class=3D"page">Engine Architecture: Component Systems</h1>
<aside class=3D"toc embedded"><div class=3D"toc-menu"><h3>Contents</h3><ul>=
<li data-level=3D"1"><a href=3D"https://docs.vulkan.org/tutorial/latest/Bui=
lding_a_Simple_Engine/Engine_Architecture/03_component_systems.html#_compon=
ent_systems">Component Systems</a></li><li data-level=3D"2"><a href=3D"http=
s://docs.vulkan.org/tutorial/latest/Building_a_Simple_Engine/Engine_Archite=
cture/03_component_systems.html#_the_problem_with_deep_inheritance">The Pro=
blem with Deep Inheritance</a></li><li data-level=3D"2"><a href=3D"https://=
docs.vulkan.org/tutorial/latest/Building_a_Simple_Engine/Engine_Architectur=
e/03_component_systems.html#_component_based_design_principles">Component-B=
ased Design Principles</a></li><li data-level=3D"2"><a href=3D"https://docs=
.vulkan.org/tutorial/latest/Building_a_Simple_Engine/Engine_Architecture/03=
_component_systems.html#_basic_component_system_implementation">Basic Compo=
nent System Implementation</a></li><li data-level=3D"2"><a href=3D"https://=
docs.vulkan.org/tutorial/latest/Building_a_Simple_Engine/Engine_Architectur=
e/03_component_systems.html#_common_component_types">Common Component Types=
</a></li><li data-level=3D"2"><a href=3D"https://docs.vulkan.org/tutorial/l=
atest/Building_a_Simple_Engine/Engine_Architecture/03_component_systems.htm=
l#_component_communication">Component Communication</a></li><li data-level=
=3D"2"><a href=3D"https://docs.vulkan.org/tutorial/latest/Building_a_Simple=
_Engine/Engine_Architecture/03_component_systems.html#_component_lifecycle_=
management">Component Lifecycle Management</a></li><li data-level=3D"2"><a =
href=3D"https://docs.vulkan.org/tutorial/latest/Building_a_Simple_Engine/En=
gine_Architecture/03_component_systems.html#_optimizing_component_access">O=
ptimizing Component Access</a></li><li data-level=3D"2"><a href=3D"https://=
docs.vulkan.org/tutorial/latest/Building_a_Simple_Engine/Engine_Architectur=
e/03_component_systems.html#_conclusion">Conclusion</a></li></ul></div></as=
ide><div class=3D"sect1">
<h2 id=3D"_component_systems"><a class=3D"anchor" href=3D"https://docs.vulk=
an.org/tutorial/latest/Building_a_Simple_Engine/Engine_Architecture/03_comp=
onent_systems.html#_component_systems"></a>Component Systems</h2>
<div class=3D"sectionbody">
<div class=3D"paragraph">
<p>In the previous section, we introduced several architectural patterns an=
d explained why we=E2=80=99re focusing on component-based architecture for =
our Vulkan rendering engine. As we established, component systems provide t=
he ideal balance of flexibility, modularity, and performance for modern ren=
dering engines. Now, let=E2=80=99s dive deeper into how to implement effect=
ive component systems in your rendering engine.</p>
</div>
<div class=3D"sect2">
<h3 id=3D"_the_problem_with_deep_inheritance"><a class=3D"anchor" href=3D"h=
ttps://docs.vulkan.org/tutorial/latest/Building_a_Simple_Engine/Engine_Arch=
itecture/03_component_systems.html#_the_problem_with_deep_inheritance"></a>=
The Problem with Deep Inheritance</h3>
<div class=3D"paragraph">
<p>Traditional game object systems often rely on deep inheritance hierarchi=
es:</p>
</div>
<div class=3D"listingblock">
<div class=3D"content">
<pre class=3D"highlightjs highlight"><code class=3D"language-cpp hljs" data=
-lang=3D"cpp"><span class=3D"hljs-class"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">class=
</span> <span class=3D"hljs-title">GameObject</span> {</span> <span class=
=3D"hljs-comment">/* ... */</span> };
<span class=3D"hljs-class"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">class</span> <span =
class=3D"hljs-title">PhysicalObject</span> :</span> <span class=3D"hljs-key=
word">public</span> GameObject { <span class=3D"hljs-comment">/* ... */</sp=
an> };
<span class=3D"hljs-class"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">class</span> <span =
class=3D"hljs-title">Character</span> :</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword"=
>public</span> PhysicalObject { <span class=3D"hljs-comment">/* ... */</spa=
n> };
<span class=3D"hljs-class"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">class</span> <span =
class=3D"hljs-title">Player</span> :</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">pu=
blic</span> Character { <span class=3D"hljs-comment">/* ... */</span> };
<span class=3D"hljs-class"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">class</span> <span =
class=3D"hljs-title">Enemy</span> :</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">pub=
lic</span> Character { <span class=3D"hljs-comment">/* ... */</span> };
<span class=3D"hljs-class"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">class</span> <span =
class=3D"hljs-title">FlyingEnemy</span> :</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keywor=
d">public</span> Enemy { <span class=3D"hljs-comment">/* ... */</span> };
<span class=3D"hljs-comment">// And so on...</span></code></pre>
<div class=3D"source-toolbox"><span class=3D"source-lang">cpp</span><button=
 class=3D"copy-button" title=3D"Copy to clipboard"><img src=3D"https://docs=
.vulkan.org/_/img/octicons-16.svg#view-clippy" alt=3D"copy icon" class=3D"c=
opy-icon" width=3D"13" height=3D"13"><span class=3D"copy-toast">Copied!</sp=
an></button></div></div>
</div>
<div class=3D"paragraph">
<p>This approach has several drawbacks:</p>
</div>
<div class=3D"olist arabic">
<ol class=3D"arabic">
<li>
<p><strong>Rigidity</strong> - Adding new combinations of behaviors require=
s creating new classes.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Code Duplication</strong> - Similar functionality may be duplica=
ted across different branches of the hierarchy.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Bloated Classes</strong> - Base classes tend to accumulate funct=
ionality over time.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Difficult Refactoring</strong> - Changes to base classes can hav=
e far-reaching consequences.</p>
</li>
</ol>
</div>
</div>
<div class=3D"sect2">
<h3 id=3D"_component_based_design_principles"><a class=3D"anchor" href=3D"h=
ttps://docs.vulkan.org/tutorial/latest/Building_a_Simple_Engine/Engine_Arch=
itecture/03_component_systems.html#_component_based_design_principles"></a>=
Component-Based Design Principles</h3>
<div class=3D"paragraph">
<p>Component-based design addresses these issues by favoring composition ov=
er inheritance:</p>
</div>
<div class=3D"olist arabic">
<ol class=3D"arabic">
<li>
<p><strong>Single Responsibility</strong> - Each component should have a si=
ngle, well-defined responsibility.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Encapsulation</strong> - Components should encapsulate their int=
ernal state and behavior.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Loose Coupling</strong> - Components should minimize dependencie=
s on other components.</p>
</li>
<li>
<p><strong>Reusability</strong> - Components should be designed for reuse a=
cross different entity types.</p>
</li>
</ol>
</div>
</div>
<div class=3D"sect2">
<h3 id=3D"_basic_component_system_implementation"><a class=3D"anchor" href=
=3D"https://docs.vulkan.org/tutorial/latest/Building_a_Simple_Engine/Engine=
_Architecture/03_component_systems.html#_basic_component_system_implementat=
ion"></a>Basic Component System Implementation</h3>
<div class=3D"paragraph">
<p>Let=E2=80=99s build a more complete component system based on the exampl=
e from the previous section:</p>
</div>
<div class=3D"listingblock">
<div class=3D"content">
<pre class=3D"highlightjs highlight"><code class=3D"language-cpp hljs" data=
-lang=3D"cpp"><span class=3D"hljs-comment">// Forward declarations</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-class"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">class</span> <span =
class=3D"hljs-title">Entity</span>;</span>

<span class=3D"hljs-comment">// Base component class</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-class"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">class</span> <span =
class=3D"hljs-title">Component</span> {</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">protected</span>:
    Entity* owner =3D <span class=3D"hljs-literal">nullptr</span>;

<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">public</span>:
    <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">virtual</span> ~Component() =3D <span clas=
s=3D"hljs-keyword">default</span>;

    <span class=3D"hljs-function"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">virtual</spa=
n> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">void</span> <span class=3D"hljs-title">Init=
ialize</span><span class=3D"hljs-params">()</span> </span>{}
    <span class=3D"hljs-function"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">virtual</spa=
n> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">void</span> <span class=3D"hljs-title">Upda=
te</span><span class=3D"hljs-params">(<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">float</s=
pan> deltaTime)</span> </span>{}
    <span class=3D"hljs-function"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">virtual</spa=
n> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">void</span> <span class=3D"hljs-title">Rend=
er</span><span class=3D"hljs-params">()</span> </span>{}

    <span class=3D"hljs-function"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">void</span> =
<span class=3D"hljs-title">SetOwner</span><span class=3D"hljs-params">(Enti=
ty* entity)</span> </span>{ owner =3D entity; }
    <span class=3D"hljs-function">Entity* <span class=3D"hljs-title">GetOwn=
er</span><span class=3D"hljs-params">()</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword"=
>const</span> </span>{ <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">return</span> owner; }
};

<span class=3D"hljs-comment">// Entity class</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-class"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">class</span> <span =
class=3D"hljs-title">Entity</span> {</span>
<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">private</span>:
    <span class=3D"hljs-built_in">std</span>::<span class=3D"hljs-built_in"=
>string</span> name;
    <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">bool</span> active =3D <span class=3D"hljs=
-literal">true</span>;
    <span class=3D"hljs-built_in">std</span>::<span class=3D"hljs-built_in"=
>vector</span>&lt;<span class=3D"hljs-built_in">std</span>::<span class=3D"=
hljs-built_in">unique_ptr</span>&lt;Component&gt;&gt; components;

<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">public</span>:
    <span class=3D"hljs-function"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">explicit</sp=
an> <span class=3D"hljs-title">Entity</span><span class=3D"hljs-params">(<s=
pan class=3D"hljs-keyword">const</span> <span class=3D"hljs-built_in">std</=
span>::<span class=3D"hljs-built_in">string</span>&amp; entityName)</span> =
: <span class=3D"hljs-title">name</span><span class=3D"hljs-params">(entity=
Name)</span> </span>{}

    <span class=3D"hljs-function"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">const</span>=
 <span class=3D"hljs-built_in">std</span>::<span class=3D"hljs-built_in">st=
ring</span>&amp; <span class=3D"hljs-title">GetName</span><span class=3D"hl=
js-params">()</span> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">const</span> </span>{ <sp=
an class=3D"hljs-keyword">return</span> name; }
    <span class=3D"hljs-function"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">bool</span> =
<span class=3D"hljs-title">IsActive</span><span class=3D"hljs-params">()</s=
pan> <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">const</span> </span>{ <span class=3D"hljs=
-keyword">return</span> active; }
    <span class=3D"hljs-function"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">void</span> =
<span class=3D"hljs-title">SetActive</span><span class=3D"hljs-params">(<sp=
an class=3D"hljs-keyword">bool</span> isActive)</span> </span>{ active =3D =
isActive; }

    <span class=3D"hljs-function"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">void</span> =
<span class=3D"hljs-title">Initialize</span><span class=3D"hljs-params">()<=
/span> </span>{
        <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">for</span> (<span class=3D"hljs-keywor=
d">auto</span>&amp; component : components) {
            component-&gt;Initialize();
        }
    }

    <span class=3D"hljs-function"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">void</span> =
<span class=3D"hljs-title">Update</span><span class=3D"hljs-params">(<span =
class=3D"hljs-keyword">float</span> deltaTime)</span> </span>{
        <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">if</span> (!active) <span class=3D"hlj=
s-keyword">return</span>;

        <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">for</span> (<span class=3D"hljs-keywor=
d">auto</span>&amp; component : components) {
            component-&gt;Update(deltaTime);
        }
    }

    <span class=3D"hljs-function"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">void</span> =
<span class=3D"hljs-title">Render</span><span class=3D"hljs-params">()</spa=
n> </span>{
        <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">if</span> (!active) <span class=3D"hlj=
s-keyword">return</span>;

        <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">for</span> (<span class=3D"hljs-keywor=
d">auto</span>&amp; component : components) {
            component-&gt;Render();
        }
    }

    <span class=3D"hljs-function"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">template</sp=
an>&lt;<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">typename</span> T, <span class=3D"hljs-=
keyword">typename</span>... Args&gt;
    T* <span class=3D"hljs-title">AddComponent</span><span class=3D"hljs-pa=
rams">(Args&amp;&amp;... args)</span> </span>{
        <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">static_assert</span>(<span class=3D"hl=
js-built_in">std</span>::is_base_of&lt;Component, T&gt;::value, <span class=
=3D"hljs-string">"T must derive from Component"</span>);

        <span class=3D"hljs-comment">// Create new component</span>
        <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">auto</span> component =3D <span class=
=3D"hljs-built_in">std</span>::make_unique&lt;T&gt;(<span class=3D"hljs-bui=
lt_in">std</span>::forward&lt;Args&gt;(args)...);
        T* componentPtr =3D component.get();
        componentPtr-&gt;SetOwner(<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">this</span>)=
;
        components.push_back(<span class=3D"hljs-built_in">std</span>::move=
(component));
        <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">return</span> componentPtr;
    }

    <span class=3D"hljs-function"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">template</sp=
an>&lt;<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">typename</span> T&gt;
    T* <span class=3D"hljs-title">GetComponent</span><span class=3D"hljs-pa=
rams">()</span> </span>{
        <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">for</span> (<span class=3D"hljs-keywor=
d">auto</span>&amp; component : components) {
            <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">if</span> (T* result =3D <span cla=
ss=3D"hljs-keyword">dynamic_cast</span>&lt;T*&gt;(component.get())) {
                <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">return</span> result;
            }
        }
        <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class=3D"hljs-lite=
ral">nullptr</span>;
    }

    <span class=3D"hljs-function"><span class=3D"hljs-keyword">template</sp=
an>&lt;<span class=3D"hljs-keyword">typename</span> T&gt;
    <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">bool</span> <span class=3D"hljs-title">Rem=
oveComponent</span><span class=3D"hljs-params">()</span> </span>{
        <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">for</span> (<span class=3D"hljs-keywor=
d">auto</span> it =3D components.begin(); it !=3D components.end(); ++it) {
            <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">if</span> (<span class=3D"hljs-key=
word">dynamic_cast</span>&lt;T*&gt;(it-&gt;get())) {
                components.erase(it);
                <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class=3D"h=
ljs-literal">true</span>;
            }
        }
        <span class=3D"hljs-keyword">return</span> <span class=3D"hljs-lite=
ral">false</span>;
    }
};</code></pre>
